# DS-0002: "Image user should not be 'root'" (Dockerfile)
# Standard php:apache pattern — Apache master starts as root, then
# privilege-drops to www-data for worker processes. The entrypoint also
# needs root briefly for migrations and storage-permission setup. Already
# dismissed upstream as "won't fix" on GitHub Security tab (alert #1617).
